   "body": "### First pass, build `56fbc564`, simulators (iPhone 18 Pro, iPad Pro 13, iOS 27.0), no device connected\n\nNo crash, no data loss, no privacy leak. Nothing sent to the forum.\n\n| PR | Pass | Fail | Not run | Notes |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| #458 | 6 | 3 | 1 | Colour tag without `#`: #515. No focus on open: #516. Same clipboard re-offered: under check, may be simulator pasteboard |\n| #459 | 4 | 0 | 2 | |\n| #466 | 5 | 0 | 3 | Stopped at the filled form |\n| #470 | 1 | 0 | device items | Upload off without key, as expected |\n| #460 | 2 | 0 | 3 | Comparison with legacy not done |\n| #457 | 5 | 0 | 3 | |\n| #463 | 5 | 1 | 2 | Header at Dynamic Type XL, one character per line: #522 |\n| #465 | 1 | 1 | 3 | YouTube player error, seen once: being reproduced |\n| #472 | 3 | 0 | 3 | |\n| #469 | 3 | 0 | 3 | Repeat needs a flagged topic. See the comment of 2026-11-05 on #469 |\n| #486 | 4 | 0 | 1 | |\n| #462 | 3 | 0 | 3 | Display only |\n| #464 | 2 | 0 | 3 | About 28 s of loading on a long topic: slow, not broken |\n| #487 | 6 | 0 | 2 | |\n| #488 | 4 | 0 | 3 | Group row subtitle truncates |\n| #489 | 6 | 0 | 2 | |\n\nA second pass on a newer build runs the items left and re-checks #515, #516, #522.\n",
