   "body": "### Second pass, build `07b65784`, simulators, no device connected\n\nThat build predates #515, #516, #522, all merged since, so those fixes were tested only in their own PRs. No crash, data loss, privacy leak or wrong forum write. Nothing sent to the forum.\n\n- #458: \"Lien\" re-offers the same clipboard after \"Oui\" (3 of 4 taps). The model's logic is right and a plain `pbcopy` never triggers it; likely the simulator's pasteboard counter. To confirm on a device.\n- #460: a real drag turns the page, a diagonal one does not. Fail: a drag with a text selection turns the page, #534. Not run: swipe off, spoilers.\n- #463: \"Link\" as a title matches legacy (`MessagePopupMenuPolicyTests`).\n- #465: YouTube player error not reproduced, seen once; LOT-071 R3 sends no Referer to third parties, so any fix is a decision.\n- #472: `reho.st` thumbnails open the viewer in legacy (`OnlineMessagesTableViewController.m:1217`); on this build plain links stayed links, to compare.\n- Fixed since the first pass: #515 colour tag, #516 first focus, #522 header at large sizes. #522 was seen in a test host, not in the real app at `accessibility-extra-large`.\n\n### Left for a device or a next pass\n\nReal upload and EXIF (#470, waits for #471's key), camera, cellular, airplane mode; VoiceOver and status-bar release (#469, needs a flagged fixture topic); Duo; HD gallery gestures, dark and XL (#472); Vimeo, Streamable, \"Ouvrir le lien\" (#465); XL and dark on most lists.\n\nScreenshots: PR \"Mac checks: M2 cloud lots\".\n",
